Package profiles. One manifest per profile: NAME.list.
  @requires NAME   install this profile first (dependency)
  @keep            part of the base image (stays in the live ISO); listed so it can be reinstalled
  anything else    a path (shell glob) relative to the image root; every other profile is
                   stripped from the live ISO and published as profile-NAME.tar.xz
Build with tools/profiles/build-profiles.sh; install on a running system with `get --profile NAME`.
